2026-07-27T14:15:10.1172452Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:15:10.1173222Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:15:10.1174382Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:15:10.1175420Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
